INSERT INTO `transfers` VALUES (94,'Hotel','Boulevard Tour + Shooting range','Private Transfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'10:00 – Leaving Hotel to Baku Boulevard \n\n Baku boulevard tour starts along the Baku Boulevard followed by: \n - Carpet Museum \n - Mini Venice of Baku\n - Deniz Mall \n - Ferries Wheel \n - Carpet Museums\n - Cristal Hall\n\n 13:00 – Lunch Break\n\n 14:00 – Shooting Experience Begins\n - Visit the Baku Shooting Center, one of Europe’s largest and most advanced shooting facilities. The center offers professional equipment, safe practice zones, and a memorable shooting experience for beginners and enthusiasts.\n\n 18:00 – Dinner Break (if included)\n\n 19:00 –Drop to Hotel\n\n Overnight in Baku',35.00,38.00,40.00,50.00,88.00,147.00,177.00,206.00,206.00,20.00,47.00);
INSERT INTO `transfers` VALUES (95,'Hotel','Boulevard Tour + Indoor Go Karting','Private Transfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'10:00 – Leaving Hotel to Baku Boulevard \n Baku boulevard tour starts along the Baku Boulevard followed by: \n - Carpet Museum \n - Mini Venice of Baku\n - Deniz Mall \n - Ferries Wheel \n - Carpet Museums\n - Cristal Hall\n \n13:00 – Lunch Break\n\n 14:00 – Shooting Range \n - At the shooting range, you enjoy a hands-on shooting session under proper supervision. The experience includes safe guidance from trained staff, the use of selected firearms, and the opportunity to test your accuracy and focus. It’s an exciting and controlled activity designed for both beginners and experienced participants.\n \n 18:00 – Dinner Break (if included)\n\n 19:00 –Drop to Hotel\n\n Overnight in Baku',35.00,38.00,40.00,50.00,88.00,147.00,177.00,206.00,206.00,20.00,47.00);
INSERT INTO `transfers` VALUES (96,'Hotel','Boulevard Tour + Outdoor Go Karting','Private Transfer',NULL,NULL,NULL,'10:00 – Leaving Hotel to Baku Boulevard \n\n Baku boulevard tour starts along the Baku Boulevard followed by: \n - Carpet Museum \n - Mini Venice of Baku\n - Deniz Mall \n - Ferries Wheel \n - Carpet Museums\n - Cristal Hall\n\n 13:00 – Lunch Break\n\n 14:00 – Outdoor Go Karting Track \n\n - At the track, you enjoy an exciting karting session in a dynamic outdoor setting. With spacious racing lanes, fresh air, and modern karts, the experience delivers a thrilling blend of speed and adrenaline. Safety gear is provided on-site, allowing you to enjoy the activity confidently and comfortably.\n \n 18:00 – Dinner Break (if included)\n\n 19:00 –Drop to Hotel\n\n Overnight in Baku',35.00,38.00,40.00,50.00,88.00,147.00,177.00,206.00,206.00,20.00,47.00);
